 "report": {
  "uncertain": [
   "グラップ・コンビネーション = 'Grap Combination' (Zambot Grap, wiki romanization); battle voice g337 says 'Grapple' for グラップさばき.",
   "太陽エネルギー解放 = 'Solar Energy Unleashed' (voice g342: 'Unleash the solar energy!'); short 'Solar Unleashed'.",
   "侵食 (ELS) = 'Erosion', matching voice g170; official English may differ.",
   "Ｇファルコン連携攻撃 = 'G-Falcon Link Attack' (coined; no Jigoku/voice precedent).",
   "連射 short forms use 'RF' (Solid Shooter RF, HE Beam Rifle RF, Twin Buster Max RF); 最大出力 short = 'Max'.",
   "４連装メガ粒子砲 short 'Quad Mega Particle' (drops 'Cannon' to fit 18)."
  ],
  "notes": "Jigoku weapons.json reused where it had the same Japanese (Solid Shooter, Sturmgewehr, Catapult Launcher, Arondight, Flash Edge 2, 17.5mm/31mm CIWS, Super DRAGOON, Callidus Beam Cannon, Long-Range Beam Cannon, High-Energy Beam Rifle, Heavy Machinegun Kai). Moonlight Butterfly and Trans-Am from glossary; 突撃 = Charge and 分離攻撃 = Separation Attack per Jigoku."
 }
